                <note rend="inline" type="source">838.51/1128: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Haiti</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Bailly-Blanchard</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-08-17T16:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">August 17,
                                1921—4 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>49. Your 56, August 10, 4 p.m.</p>
                <p>Payments to President and officials named to have precedence over Sanitation and
                    Public Works but not over Constabulary. Settlement outlined approved.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
